# What NOT to upload with `vercel deploy`.
#
# This file has to exist. Without it the Vercel CLI falls back to .gitignore,
# and .gitignore excludes public/thumbs and public/detail — 187 MB of artwork
# that is deliberately kept out of the repository but must still be deployed.
# Relying on the fallback would ship a site with no images and no error.

node_modules
.next
.git
.env*
docs
scripts
*.test.ts
vitest.config.ts
